## The raycomposite_mirror scene without the panel: the lit wall alone in the 45 degree mirror, the reference the
## panel's block reads against. Not third-party.
Display "raycomposite_mirror_bare.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 64 48 1
PixelSamples 2 2
Option "pathtracer" "integer samples" [64]
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "distantlight" 1 "from" [-1 0 3] "to" [0 0 0] "intensity" [3]
Surface "matte" "Kd" [0.8]
Polygon "P" [9 -8 -4  9 8 -4  9 8 10  9 -8 10]
AttributeBegin
Surface "mirror"
Polygon "P" [0.2 -6 1.2  0.2 6 1.2  6 6 7  6 -6 7]
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
